cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Ataxia in your teaching or research, please cite it
  using this metadata.
title: >-
  Ataxia — derailment for embodied agents: a harness for inducing and
  measuring psychopathology-like behavioral distortions in robot
  policies, in simulation
type: software
authors:
  - name: Ataxia contributors
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/haetae-robotics/ataxia"
abstract: >-
  Ataxia manipulates attention, episodic memory, belief and
  action-selection variables in simulated robot policies to induce
  psychopathology-like behavioral distortions, and measures the
  degradation episode-by-episode against a healthy baseline with
  eleven instruments and 0-3 symptom scales. Emulation, not diagnosis.
keywords:
  - embodied ai
  - robotics
  - psychopathology
  - evaluation harness
  - chaos engineering
